      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1915-07-17_WidnesExaminer_art0120" n="art0120">
        <head>EXAMINER, SATURDAY, JULY 17, 1915.</head>
        <p>THE EXAMINER, SATURDAY, JULY 17, 1915.</p>
        <p>period in England he was drafted to the Front.</p>
